# Scoped build-context excludes only.
# Keep this file narrow: `COPY . .` plus compile-time inputs must stay in
# context, notably Cargo.toml, crates/ (sources, build.rs, migrations,
# src/ui.html), scripts/agent-rootfs-build.sh (embedded via include_str! in
# lazyteam-worker), and deploy/docker-entrypoint.sh (copied into the runtime
# image). Do not add broad patterns for those paths, *.toml, *.sql,
# *.html, or *.sh.
.git
target
**/target
